1075
00:52:05.000 --> 00:52:06.000
[sirens wailing]

1076
00:52:06.000 --> 00:52:09.000
Oh. Ah. Uh...

1077
00:52:09.000 --> 00:52:10.000
Tim! Tim.

1078
00:52:10.000 --> 00:52:12.000
