Oh, I hate my job.

1179
00:57:34.000 --> 00:57:35.000
Whew.

1180
00:57:35.000 --> 00:57:37.000
[groans]

1181
00:57:37.000 --> 00:57:39.000
Stupid kids.

1182
00:57:39.000 --> 00:57:41.000
[grunts]
[grunts]

1183
00:57:41.000 --> 00:57:43.000
[yells, grunts]

1184
